  "details": "There's no way to add more months / years to vrc+ through the game from steam as it just wants to extend the current / last purchase running out rather than giving the option to add more months or years to it, would be nice to be able to actually buy example 1 month ontop of the current vrc+ .. it seems that u will have to wait for it to run out to renew it rather than being able to buy ontop, which also causes issues in terms of how much u would like to purchase ontop, example, i have 1 year vrc+ running out, the only option i get is to renew my 1year vrc+ once it runs out, if i were to add just a single month to it, i literally would have to wait for it to run out so well as if i were to renew my 1 year .. i would love to have the option to just buy as much vrc+ as i would like at whatever time i would like and not having to wait for it to run out aswell as having all options of vrc+ extension to be added ontop .",
